From 506b4e46f9567308ca18494593e6a4d932f40852 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lij768423-svg <lij768423@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 09:26:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: withhold missing-thinking streams and retry another
 account

Hold thinking-model SSE until reasoning appears or enough visible
output arrives with none. Do not deliver that first body; switch
accounts up to five more times. After six misses, fail closed with
503 instead of sending a no-thinking reply. Default off.
